# 📈 Stock Market Dashboard

A free, real-time stock market dashboard built with **Streamlit**, **yfinance**, and **Plotly**. Supports US, Indian (NSE/BSE), UK stocks, and Crypto — no paid API required.

---

## 🖥️ Demo Preview

> Type any stock ticker (e.g. `AAPL`, `RELIANCE.NS`, `BTC-USD`) and instantly get live charts, technical indicators, and company info with logo.

---

## ✨ Features

- 📊 **Interactive Charts** — Candlestick & Line charts with volume bars
- 📉 **Technical Indicators** — RSI, MACD, Bollinger Bands, SMA (20 & 50 day)
- 🏢 **Auto Company Logo** — Fetches real logo for any company automatically
- 💹 **Key Metrics** — Current Price, Day High, Day Low, Volume
- 📈 **Returns Analysis** — Daily returns histogram, Sharpe Ratio, Mean & Std Dev
- 🔀 **Multi-Stock Comparison** — Compare up to 5 stocks on a normalized chart
- 📥 **CSV Export** — Download historical OHLCV data with one click
- 🌍 **Global Stock Support** — US, Indian (NSE/BSE), UK, and Crypto markets

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| [Streamlit](https://streamlit.io/) | Web app framework |
| [yfinance](https://pypi.org/project/yfinance/) | Free Yahoo Finance API |
| [Plotly](https://plotly.com/) | Interactive charts |
| [Pandas](https://pandas.pydata.org/) | Data processing & indicators |
| [Requests](https://pypi.org/project/requests/) | Logo fetching |

---

## 🚀 Getting Started

### 1. Clone the repository

\```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/stock-market-dashboard.git
cd stock-market-dashboard
\```

### 2. Install dependencies

\```bash
pip install streamlit yfinance plotly pandas requests
\```

### 3. Run the app

\```bash
streamlit run app.py
\```

The app will open automatically at `http://localhost:8501`

